WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.767
-Welcome, welcome,
welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:06.767
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:09.000
Guys, it is that time
of year again.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.534
Tomorrow is Santacon.

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:13.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:15.400
That's right.
Here in New York City,

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.601
thousands of people
will dress up as Santa

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:21.200
and pack the streets
for an all-day bar crawl.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.501
Yep.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:25.968
Things kick off in Midtown
at 10 a.m.

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:27.501
and then end asleep
on a sidewalk,

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:30.100
spooning a trash bag
at 2 p.m..

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.300
So you're gonna want
to wake the kids

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.100
for that one.
That's right.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.968
Thousands in Midtown
will be dressed in red suits

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:38.667
and begin drinking
at 10 a.m.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:40.834
Right now, Times Square Elmo is
like, "Oh, sure,

00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:42.734
but when I do it..."

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:50.501
Some political news tonight.
President Biden was in LA

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:55.267
for a campaign fundraiser
with Steven Spielberg.

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:57.400
Yeah, Biden knows
Spielberg's work well.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.434
Anytime his staff
brings his poll numbers,

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:01.367
he hears the theme from "Jaws."

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:05.267
Of course,
because it's Hollywood.

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:07.801
Biden won't admit his approval
rating is shrinking.

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.801
He just says
it's on Ozempic.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.634
Speaking of Biden,
earlier today,

00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:16.200
he announced
the largest investment

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:22.267
in passenger rail transportation
since the creation of Amtrak.

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:24.767
The largest investment
since the creation of Amtrak,

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:26.200
which is big for Biden
because he was there

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.000
for the creation of the wheel.

00:01:30.601 --> 00:01:33.901
Yeah, Biden just announced
a massive new rail investment,

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:35.934
and we actually got
our hands on the message

00:01:35.934 --> 00:01:38.067
Biden recorded that
they're playing on every train

00:01:38.067 --> 00:01:40.133
in the country
starting today.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.734
Yeah. Check this out.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:14.100
-I think that's fantastic.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.067
What?

00:02:16.067 --> 00:02:17.334
Come on.
-Pocket full of salamanders?

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:19.868
-Yeah. Pocket full
of salamanders. That's right.

00:02:19.868 --> 00:02:21.300
Well, people are talking
about this.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:25.334
Last night, Hunter Biden was
indicted on nine tax charges.

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:27.000
Yeah, in a 56-page indictment,

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.033
he's accused of dodging
federal taxes,

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:32.334
making false payments
on Venmo, and fraud.

00:02:32.334 --> 00:02:33.901
Well, when asked
how he feels about Hunter

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:35.133
not paying his taxes,

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:39.300
President Biden said
it is very disappointing.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.901
While former President
Trump said...

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:47.100
Next, when asked how he feels
about Hunter Venmoing

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.200
$1,500 to an exotic dancer,

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.767
President Biden
said it's irresponsible,

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:52.767
while Trump said...

00:03:02.968 --> 00:03:06.033
And finally, when asked if
he'd consider pardoning Hunter,

00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:08.968
President Biden said no.
Trump said...

00:03:13.367 --> 00:03:16.901
-What? Wow.

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:18.267
-Some news from overseas.

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:19.734
I saw that Vladimir Putin
announced

00:03:19.734 --> 00:03:22.400
that he's running
for president of Russia again.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.701
Wow. I don't want to say
their elections are phony,

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:28.067
but on their "I voted" stickers,
the word "voted" is in quotes.

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:32.033
Some business news --

00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:36.968
Krispy Kreme just opened their
first French location in Paris.

00:03:36.968 --> 00:03:40.434
Finally, a place to get
decent pastry in Paris.

00:03:44.734 --> 00:03:47.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.501 --> 00:03:49.934
You guys see this?
Pantone just announced

00:03:49.934 --> 00:03:54.934
their 2024 color of the year
is Peach Fuzz.

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:57.400
Yeah. Can we see
a picture of Peach Fuzz?

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:00.400
Hey, that's why I --
Come on! Hey!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.601
Hey, why --

00:04:02.601 --> 00:04:03.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:03.667 --> 00:04:05.801
-Hey.

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:08.133
-Uh, well, this is wild.

00:04:08.133 --> 00:04:09.834
Authorities at an airport
in Thailand

00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:12.167
caught a man smuggling
two otters

00:04:12.167 --> 00:04:15.868
and a prairie dog
in his pants.

00:04:15.868 --> 00:04:17.667
Not much you can really do
after that other than yell,

00:04:17.667 --> 00:04:20.801
"Ta da!"
I mean, really?

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:22.667
Well, get this. I read about
a couple in Florida

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:26.133
who got married while
going through a car wash.

00:04:26.133 --> 00:04:27.701
Good thing about getting
married in a car wash

00:04:27.701 --> 00:04:29.701
is that the 10th one's free.

00:04:33.367 --> 00:04:37.133
-Finally, guys,
we have exactly 11 shows left

00:04:37.133 --> 00:04:38.734
before we go
on Christmas break,

00:04:38.734 --> 00:04:40.267
which means it's time
for that beloved

00:04:40.267 --> 00:04:41.467
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:04:41.467 --> 00:04:45.133
It's time for 12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters.

00:04:45.133 --> 00:04:47.434
-♪ 12 days of Christmas
sweaters ♪

00:04:47.434 --> 00:04:51.000
♪ 11 days left ♪

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.734
-That's right.

00:04:54.734 --> 00:04:57.367
Every show between now
and Christmas,

00:04:57.367 --> 00:04:59.601
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:04:59.601 --> 00:05:02.334
a bodacious
Christmas sweater

00:05:02.334 --> 00:05:04.567
from the countdown
to Christmas cabinet.

00:05:04.567 --> 00:05:09.501
Since there are 11 shows left,
let's open door number 11.

00:05:09.501 --> 00:05:12.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:14.434
♪♪

00:05:14.434 --> 00:05:16.033
Oh.

00:05:16.033 --> 00:05:22.267
♪♪

00:05:22.267 --> 00:05:24.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.667
That's nice.
Thank you very much.

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:33.100
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.634
Everyone look
at your seat number.

00:05:35.634 --> 00:05:38.467
I need you to jump up
and let me know where you are

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:39.868
if you get --
if I say your number.

00:05:39.868 --> 00:05:42.334
Quest,
can I get a drum roll, please?

00:05:42.334 --> 00:05:43.367
Who wants me
to pick their number?

00:05:43.367 --> 00:05:45.334
This is good.

00:05:45.334 --> 00:05:48.033
♪♪

00:05:48.033 --> 00:05:50.767
-448.

00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:52.934
♪♪

00:05:52.934 --> 00:05:55.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:55.033 --> 00:06:09.467
♪♪

00:06:09.467 --> 00:06:12.501
-Alright. Oh, man.

00:06:12.501 --> 00:06:14.667
♪♪

00:06:14.667 --> 00:06:15.934
Here we go.

00:06:15.934 --> 00:06:18.667
We can do a little --
Come over here. Gosh.

00:06:18.667 --> 00:06:23.267
How are you? Barely made it
on the standby line there, huh?

00:06:23.267 --> 00:06:26.801
Uh, you don't want to come down
one step towards me? Come on.

00:06:26.801 --> 00:06:28.868
Gosh, I just walked up --
How you doing?

00:06:28.868 --> 00:06:33.434
-Hi. Hi, I'm Mark.
-Oh, what is --

00:06:33.434 --> 00:06:35.167
-What is your name?
-Mark.

00:06:35.167 --> 00:06:37.634
-Yeah. Uh, Mark,
where are you from?

00:06:37.634 --> 00:06:39.300
-I'm from Spain.
-Hey.

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:43.467
Welcome.
Thank you for being here.

00:06:43.467 --> 00:06:46.067
Mark, it gets a little chilly
sometimes in Spain, correct?

00:06:46.067 --> 00:06:47.367
-Yeah. It is.
-Yeah. Cold.

00:06:47.367 --> 00:06:49.534
Right? I mean, you have this.
This is very nice.

00:06:49.534 --> 00:06:53.133
I love this fleece.
Whatever it is, it's gorgeous.

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:56.901
Do you have anything like this?
-No, I don't, I don't, I don't.

00:06:56.901 --> 00:06:58.400
-Have you ever seen
anything like this?

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.367
-No.
-No, never.

00:07:00.367 --> 00:07:01.467
Would you like to try it on?

00:07:01.467 --> 00:07:03.400
-Yeah, sure.
-Yeah, I think you should.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.534
You can put it over that.

00:07:06.534 --> 00:07:08.968
I want to make it
as uncomfortable as possible.

00:07:08.968 --> 00:07:10.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:10.567 --> 00:07:12.667
♪♪

00:07:12.667 --> 00:07:15.234
And this is the front.
This is the front, I think.

00:07:15.234 --> 00:07:16.467
The good thing
about this sweater

00:07:16.467 --> 00:07:19.767
is there's no front or back.

00:07:19.767 --> 00:07:22.334
You just put it on and hope
for the best, you know?

00:07:22.334 --> 00:07:23.834
Oh, this is great, Mark.
Yeah.

00:07:23.834 --> 00:07:26.067
Oh, yeah. That's right.

00:07:26.067 --> 00:07:29.033
Oh, wow. He made it through.
He made it through.

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:31.200
Look at that.
That looks fantastic.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:34.000
Look at how good you look.
Fantastic, buddy.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.000
-Thank you.
-Welcome.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.133
Thank you for being here. Enjoy.

00:07:36.133 --> 00:07:37.501
Happy holidays, buddy.
-Thank you.

00:07:37.501 --> 00:07:38.534
-Give it up for Mark, everybody.

00:07:38.534 --> 00:07:40.033
Stick around.
When we come back,

00:07:40.033 --> 00:07:42.467
we're doing something fun
with Anne Hathaway.

